    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <i>HOPE</i>, where The Benevolent Father leads your joyful cult.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get ready for a <strong>story-rich daylight horror adventure</strong> in NAME OF THE WILL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079920/extras/32ecd5eccc2593a8d0a494ab3b930f8d.poster.avif?t=1746880320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079920/extras/32ecd5eccc2593a8d0a494ab3b930f8d.webm?t=1746880320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079920/extras/32ecd5eccc2593a8d0a494ab3b930f8d.mp4?t=1746880320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>NAME OF THE WILL</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 6-hour descent into a hand-drawn Asian euphoric cult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Befriend your neighbors by day. At night, sneak through their secrets before they catch you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack the cult system by solving puzzles and mini games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fear of peer pressure, interrogations and eerie rules you must obey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refusing can be defiance: the only true way out is to forge your own path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump between past and present to reshape both timelines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Unique endings + 1 hidden ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Electronic music created by award-winning composer</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <i>HOPE</i>, where The Benevolent Father leads your joyful cult.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get ready for a <strong>story-rich daylight horror adventure</strong> in NAME OF THE WILL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079920/extras/32ecd5eccc2593a8d0a494ab3b930f8d.poster.avif?t=1746880320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079920/extras/32ecd5eccc2593a8d0a494ab3b930f8d.webm?t=1746880320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079920/extras/32ecd5eccc2593a8d0a494ab3b930f8d.mp4?t=1746880320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>NAME OF THE WILL</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 6-hour descent into a hand-drawn Asian euphoric cult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Befriend your neighbors by day. At night, sneak through their secrets before they catch you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack the cult system by solving puzzles and mini games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fear of peer pressure, interrogations and eerie rules you must obey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refusing can be defiance: the only true way out is to forge your own path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump between past and present to reshape both timelines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Unique endings + 1 hidden ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Electronic music created by award-winning composer</p></li></ul>",
